# web/
This directory contains the formatting and rendering pieces for producing reports of monthly totals and top categories. `format.ts` supplies reusable display helpers, while `render.ts` assembles those formatted values into either plain-text or compact HTML output.

`format.ts` is the shared presentation utility layer. It converts integer-cent amounts into locale-aware currency strings, formats month keys as `YYYY-MM`, and applies configurable fixed-width alignment and padding for readable text output. These helpers keep formatting rules consistent across report views.

`render.ts` is the main report-rendering entry point. It takes monthly totals and top-category data, uses the month, currency, and padding helpers from `format.ts`, and produces either aligned plain text or compact HTML. Plain text emphasizes column alignment, while HTML provides a concise markup representation of the same report content.
